<title>CANADA: Canada sets Chile free-trade bill in Parliament.</title>
<headline>Canada sets Chile free-trade bill in Parliament.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Trade Minister Art Eggleton introduced legislation on Wednesday to implement the Canada-Chile Free Trade Agreement that had been signed in December.</p>
<p>The agreement is slated to be implemented in June if the requisite legislation is passed.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
